  "Description":      "Personal Status Extraction: extracts the entity's Personal Status from the available modalities. PS-Speech Interpretation reads the affect in the Speech Object; PS-Face Interpretation reads the affect in the Face Object; the Text Personal Status arrives ready-made from Natural Language Understanding. Personal Status Multiplexing assembles whichever per-modality Personal Statuses are present - Text, Speech, Face - into one Entity Personal Status. It combines; it does not compute.",

